---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

/*
 * Ported from the previous privacy.html, substance unchanged.
 *
 * The "SMS / Text Messaging" section below is the wording that passed A2P 10DLC
 * review. Do not reword, shorten or reorder it without reading
 * reference/a2p-10dlc-playbook.md first.
 */
---

<Legal
	title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`}
	heading="Privacy Policy"
	updated="August 2026"
>
	<p>
		Brandon Garner Photography ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy
		Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices regarding
		that information.
	</p>

	<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
	<p>When you contact us or use the chat feature on this site, we may collect:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Your name</li>
		<li>Your email address</li>
		<li>Your phone number, if you choose to provide it</li>
		<li>Any messages you send us through our contact or chat forms</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
	<p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Respond to your inquiries and booking requests</li>
		<li>Notify you when our site, booking, or services go live, if you have asked us to</li>
		<li>Send you updates about our photography services, if you have opted in</li>
		<li>
			Send text messages (SMS) related to your inquiry or booking, if you have provided your
			phone number and consented to receive them
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
	<p>
		If you provide your phone number and opt in to receive text messages, we may send you
		messages related to scheduling, booking confirmations, and updates about our services.
		Message and data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. You can opt out at any time by
		replying STOP to any message. Reply HELP for help, or contact us directly using the
		information below. Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchasing any
		goods or services. No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates
		for marketing or promotional purposes. Information sharing with subcontractors in support
		services, such as our scheduling and CRM provider, is permitted solely to deliver the
		services you request. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent are never shared
		with any third parties.
	</p>

	<h2>How We Share Information</h2>
	<p>
		We do not sell your personal information. We may share information with service providers
		who help us operate this website and manage client communications (for example, our
		customer relationship management and scheduling platform), solely for the purpose of
		providing our services to you.
	</p>

	<h2>Your Choices</h2>
	<p>
		You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying STOP, and reply HELP for help. If
		you receive email from us, you can opt out by replying to ask us to remove you, or by using
		the unsubscribe link where one is provided. You may also contact us directly to request
		that we delete your information.
	</p>

	<h2>Data Security</h2>
	<p>
		We take reasonable measures to protect the information you share with us, but no method of
		transmission or storage is 100% secure.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
	<p>
		We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page
		with an updated effective date.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact Us</h2>
	<p>
		If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at{' '}
		<a href={site.emailHref}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. Our
		mailing address is {site.address}.
	</p>
</Legal>
